# LF in the working tree on every platform, including Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true. scripts/review-workflow.js is handed to the Workflow tool
# by path, and the permission layer that reads it rejects CR as a hidden control
# character — a CRLF checkout fails the run before any agent dispatches. macOS
# and Linux already check out LF, so this is a no-op there.
* text=auto eol=lf
